# agents

Commands: spawn [--cwd DIR] [--provider NAME] [--model NAME] [--effort LEVEL] TASK, list, status [ID], send ID TEXT, wait [ID], result [ID], cancel ID.

Use '-' or no TASK to read the task from stdin. Child-only commands: report TEXT and block REASON. These work without a child ID. Modes can forbid commands; the daemon enforces the mode.
